2. Inputs a reader must obtain (not redistributable here)
--------------------------------------------------------

Base firmware   HyperOS 1.0.2.0.TKYCNXM fastboot package (CN firmware line). Provides the
                firmware and partition baseline the ROM is flashed onto.
GApps           MindTheGapps for Android 17 (17.0.0 in the setup documented here).
ReSukiSU        The kernel userspace and manager source, cloned by
                patches/apply-root-changes.sh at a pinned commit and tag. It is a git
                repository with full history because its Kbuild derives the kernel version
                code from `git rev-list --count`; a copy of its files will not do.
Manager APK     A KernelSU/ReSukiSU manager APK of the matching release. `ksud` is
                extracted from it (lib/arm64-v8a/libksud.so), which is what keeps the
                delivered userspace and a manager of that release the same release. The
                APK is a build input only: nothing here installs it. See docs/root.md for
                why shipping a manager would be a privacy cost rather than a convenience.
susfs4ksu       The KernelSU module that carries the root-hiding *policy* (which cmdline
module          parameter to spoof, which path to hide):
                https://github.com/sidex15/susfs4ksu-module, release `v1.5.2+_R28`, asset
                `ksu_module_susfs_1.5.2+.zip` (the module reports `version v1.5.2-R28`,
                `versionCode 105002028`). The module's own `update.json` names the same
                repository `ksu_module_susfs`, an address that redirects; use the one above.
                The kernel build carries SuSFS itself; this module is what makes
                `verifiedbootstate=green` appear, and it is installed on device, not shipped
                in the image. See docs/root.md.
Prebuilt        The AOSP prebuilts used by tools/framecheck/build.sh (a JDK, aapt2, d8,
toolchain       apksigner, android.jar) come from the tree the ROM is built in; they are
                not part of this repository.


